			<div class="content" id="post-content-4319643">
									

<hr />
<p><em>The spirit thrives down deep inside</em><br />
<em>That's where it's home</em><br />
<em>So let's break the ties where evil lies</em><br />
<em>And get in the zone</em></p>
<p><em>Gold (gold) dust is falling</em><br />
<em>It's raining down</em><br />
<em>Gold (gold) dust is falling</em><br />
<em>It's raining down</em></p>
<hr />
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Gold&nbsp;Spoilers</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
