<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>There's only one anomaly. The strongest desires become reality in the town of Feldspar.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Silver&nbsp;Spoilers</a></div>
