<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/manymeats" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2104082); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2104082&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1564681138" alt="ManyMeats" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2104082)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/manymeats" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2104082); return false;">ManyMeats</a></span><br />
