<p>Nice storytelling, was an enjoyable read.</p>
<p>As is tradition:</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;Show&nbsp;nitpicks</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
